* Fuzz leakage chain (transient)
.param Ileak=30m
.param vos=0

* LM358-like: 1 MHz GBW, offset vos, output limited 0.05..1.8 V (VCC-1.5 V)
.subckt LM358m inp inn out
Vos inp i2 {vos}
G1 0 x i2 inn 1m
Rp x 0 100Meg
Cp x 0 {1/(2*pi*1k*1Meg)}
E1 out 0 value={limit(V(x),0.05,1.8)}
.ends

.model BAT54 D(Is=1e-7 Rs=0.5 N=1.0 Cjo=7p Vj=0.4 M=0.5 Bv=30)

Vcc vcc 0 3.3
R5 vcc b 100k
R6 b 0 100k
C4 b 0 1u

* ZMCT103C 1000:1, secondary current = leakage/1000
I1 0 a SIN(0 {Ileak/1000} 50)
Rburden1 a 0 100
C3 a p 100n
R7 p b 100k

* Amplifier: gain 1 + 100k/1k = 101
X2 p m out LM358m
R8 m b 1k
R9 m out 100k

* Rectifier
D2 out k BAT54
C5 k 0 100n
R10 k 0 47k

.step param vos list 0 1m 3m
.tran 0 300m 0 10u
.end